WEBVTT

00:19.940 --> 00:22.490
How long are you gonna keep at it, man?

00:22.840 --> 00:24.700
I'll sleep in the morning.

00:24.700 --> 00:27.330
It's morning now, dude.

00:30.790 --> 00:31.970
Good night.

00:32.840 --> 00:34.450
Good night.

00:49.440 --> 00:51.440
<b>Miri</b>

00:56.420 --> 00:59.860
Better send over those last few things.

01:12.920 --> 01:16.550
<b>Father's Day   Thank you Papas 
Miri</b>

01:17.770 --> 01:21.450
Thank you for everything, Papas!

01:25.130 --> 01:26.080
Cut that out.

01:26.520 --> 01:28.580
Dusty in here, huh?

01:28.580 --> 01:30.430
Better air the place out.

01:38.360 --> 01:41.910
<i>Hey, I want to love, is this true love?</i>

01:41.910 --> 01:45.540
<i>Is just wanting to be loved insincere?</i>

01:45.540 --> 01:47.790
<i>What should I do?</i>

01:47.790 --> 01:50.170
<i>Oh, what should I do?</i>

01:53.460 --> 01:56.470
<i>As usual, the whole city</i>

01:56.470 --> 02:00.140
<i>Is madly in love and excited</i>

02:00.140 --> 02:03.680
<i>Extras like me just go home</i>

02:03.680 --> 02:06.980
<i>But I'm not sulking at all</i>

02:06.980 --> 02:10.810
<i>"And then you appeared suddenly</i>

02:10.810 --> 02:14.360
<i>As though you were ripping 
through those days</i>

02:14.360 --> 02:17.950
<i>With your smile that leaves me numb</i>

02:17.950 --> 02:22.280
<i>You shattered my heart</i>

02:23.450 --> 02:27.040
<i>Hey, I want to love, is this true love?</i>

02:27.040 --> 02:30.670
<i>Is just wanting to be loved insincere?</i>

02:30.670 --> 02:32.840
<i>What should I do?</i>

02:32.840 --> 02:35.170
<i>Oh, what should I do?</i>

02:35.460 --> 02:37.550
<i>How the heck should I know?</i>

02:37.550 --> 02:41.390
<i>I don't know what's going on in your head</i>

02:41.390 --> 02:45.060
<i>But it's not fair that you're so friendly</i>

02:45.060 --> 02:49.770
<i>Once again, I'm being 
swallowed up by your rhythm</i>

02:51.940 --> 02:56.610
<i>There you go, you've got me 
wrapped around your finger again</i>

03:02.910 --> 03:07.790
<i>There you go, you've got me 
wrapped around your finger again</i>

03:29.640 --> 03:30.600
<b>Choco Rings</b>

03:34.860 --> 03:40.240
<b>Choco Rings</b>

03:48.670 --> 03:50.740
He's been sitting there all day!

03:50.740 --> 03:52.170
He's very suspicious!

03:52.170 --> 03:54.320
Should we call the police, do you think?

03:54.320 --> 03:57.160
Let's just keep our children away from him.

03:57.360 --> 03:59.680
<i>Is this passe? Passe?</i>

03:59.680 --> 04:01.360
<i>What's "passe"?</i>

04:01.360 --> 04:02.800
<i>What do you think, Nigo?</i>

04:02.800 --> 04:06.050
<i>Aw, you don't know? That's no good...</i>

04:06.050 --> 04:09.010
<i>Of course I know! But passe...</i>

04:09.550 --> 04:12.680
<i>It was a tragic case for this family.</i>

04:12.940 --> 04:16.230
<i>We should make sure nothing 
like this ever happens again.</i>

04:27.540 --> 04:31.300
Haven't seen you smoke in a while.

04:32.150 --> 04:36.180
You're the one who told me not 
to get the smell on Miri.

04:36.180 --> 04:37.220
Did I say that?

04:37.820 --> 04:39.140
Ahh...

04:39.500 --> 04:40.670
<i>Did</i> I say that?

04:43.510 --> 04:47.670
Never realized how quiet it was 
here when Miri's not around.

04:48.250 --> 04:50.610
Total silence except for 
the sound of your games.

04:50.930 --> 04:53.640
<b>Potato Chips
Lightly Salted</b>

04:51.220 --> 04:53.650
You're messing up your 
cooking a lot now too.

04:53.650 --> 04:56.890
If you don't like it, feel free to order in.

04:56.890 --> 04:58.520
I did before.

05:00.470 --> 05:01.570
I hope...

05:02.170 --> 05:04.860
I hope Miri's eating right.

05:07.160 --> 05:10.110
No worries. I'm sure she is.

05:14.500 --> 05:17.950
I think I'll go back to 
my dad in the new year.

05:19.130 --> 05:20.990
He told me to come back.

05:23.270 --> 05:27.470
Yeah... not like there's much reason 
for us to stay together now.

05:27.470 --> 05:29.550
You can have the apartment.

05:30.240 --> 05:31.590
Use it however you want.

05:33.990 --> 05:37.610
Nah, think I'll find a smaller place.

05:37.610 --> 05:41.340
This is way too much apartment 
for just little ol' me...

05:43.420 --> 05:44.920
It's weird.

05:44.920 --> 05:50.040
I can't even remember what 
life was like before Miri.

05:51.380 --> 05:52.200
Kazuki...

05:54.140 --> 05:55.090
Take it.

05:59.950 --> 06:02.150
This is your parting gift?

06:03.320 --> 06:05.010
Here we are!

06:07.250 --> 06:09.390
Hamburg steak!

06:09.740 --> 06:12.070
You like Hamburg steak, don't you?

06:12.070 --> 06:14.380
Yes! Thank you for the food!

06:23.210 --> 06:26.270
Mama, this isn't the one you always make!

06:27.590 --> 06:30.480
It's better than that cheap one, isn't it?

06:30.480 --> 06:33.290
I worked hard to make it right.

06:33.290 --> 06:35.780
Go on. Eat your veggies too.

06:36.070 --> 06:39.970
I'm going to work hard to make up for 
everything you've had to go without.

06:39.970 --> 06:40.820
Okay!

06:45.060 --> 06:47.260
I like this one too!

06:48.120 --> 06:50.900
What did you do in daycare today?

06:50.900 --> 06:53.740
Today, we practiced singing!

06:53.740 --> 06:57.860
Did I tell you? Anna-chan's scary
 when she plays piano!

06:58.540 --> 06:59.980
Is she really?

07:00.890 --> 07:03.400
<b>Yadorigi
Coffee • Light Meals</b>

07:01.640 --> 07:07.410
C'mon, Kyu-chan. Got any work for me?

07:07.410 --> 07:10.330
Nothing I'd be comfortable 
giving you right now.

07:10.330 --> 07:13.240
I'll do any damn thing you ask for.

07:13.610 --> 07:14.360
Here.

07:15.040 --> 07:15.790
Eh?

07:16.040 --> 07:18.190
That should cover your expenses for a while.

07:18.840 --> 07:21.870
Hey, that's one I left for Karin!

07:22.170 --> 07:25.390
Give it all back! Now!

07:25.390 --> 07:27.630
If I give it all to you 
at once, you'll spend it.

07:27.630 --> 07:29.880
What are you, my mom?

07:32.330 --> 07:36.670
She meant more to you than I thought.

07:36.670 --> 07:38.450
What was that?

07:38.450 --> 07:39.770
Nothing.

07:39.770 --> 07:40.800
What's Rei up to?

07:41.290 --> 07:43.700
Said he was going back to his dad.

07:43.700 --> 07:48.950
Headed out early this morning, 
so he was probably going to tell him.

07:49.300 --> 07:50.380
I see.

07:50.380 --> 07:53.720
You think he really wants to go back there?

07:54.200 --> 07:56.370
He has no other choice.

07:56.370 --> 07:58.080
That's how his household is.

07:59.020 --> 08:00.620
Rubs me the wrong way.

08:01.140 --> 08:03.450
Both Rei and his dad.

08:05.750 --> 08:07.790
You wish to return?

08:07.790 --> 08:09.630
Yes, Boss.

08:09.630 --> 08:11.050
Good.

08:11.400 --> 08:15.170
You will henceforth remain by 
my side and learn my business.

08:16.040 --> 08:20.210
Everything I was given from the 
Suwa family, I give to you.

08:20.680 --> 08:24.180
Everything, in the manner 
it has always been.

08:25.380 --> 08:27.620
Thank you, sir.

08:28.180 --> 08:32.360
Silent night.

08:32.360 --> 08:36.490
Holy night.

08:36.490 --> 08:40.990
All is calm.

08:40.990 --> 08:44.820
All is bright.

08:43.900 --> 08:50.850
Sleep in heavenly peace.

08:53.220 --> 08:54.810
You're very good.

08:55.950 --> 08:59.840
Anna-chan and Hinata-chan said I'm good too!

08:59.840 --> 09:03.050
You're a singer's daughter. 
Of course you are!

09:09.530 --> 09:12.860
Papa Kazuki and Papa Rei said I'm good too!

09:13.350 --> 09:17.880
When are they gonna come get me?

09:17.880 --> 09:18.810
Miri...

09:19.500 --> 09:22.790
Those men aren't really your papas.

09:23.960 --> 09:28.040
Papa Kazuki and Papa Rei 
<i>are</i> my papas, though.

09:28.040 --> 09:31.360
Papa Kazuki is good at cooking.

09:31.360 --> 09:34.440
Papa Rei is good at games!

09:34.440 --> 09:37.830
Sometimes they make me 
eat mushrooms, though.

09:37.830 --> 09:41.300
But I still really love my papas!

09:41.640 --> 09:45.340
I wish we could all live together!

09:46.460 --> 09:47.570
Mama?

09:47.570 --> 09:50.180
I'm sorry I made you feel so lonely.

09:50.730 --> 09:52.540
But don't worry.

09:52.890 --> 09:54.740
I'm going to change.

09:55.300 --> 09:58.060
I'm going to be a mother you love.

10:00.750 --> 10:03.870
I do love you, Mama!

10:05.440 --> 10:10.050
Before you learn the business, 
there's something that must be done.

10:11.640 --> 10:14.530
You haven't closed the book on all your affairs.

10:21.170 --> 10:24.030
You haven't cut those pointless ties.

10:24.650 --> 10:29.990
You're trapped there, like a 
child at a storefront window,

10:30.480 --> 10:32.870
staring at a toy he cannot have.

10:33.330 --> 10:36.110
In time it will become a shackle,

10:36.110 --> 10:39.010
and lead to disgrace for the Suwa name.

10:39.750 --> 10:42.240
But there's no need to worry.

10:42.610 --> 10:44.710
I'll purge it for you.

10:49.050 --> 10:51.120
Please, don't hurt Miri!

10:51.500 --> 10:53.540
Don't debase yourself like this.

10:54.020 --> 10:56.500
I'll carry out any job you give me.

10:56.500 --> 10:58.330
I'll kill anyone you ask for!

10:58.330 --> 11:00.330
Just leave Miri—

11:00.330 --> 11:03.230
This fixation is the problem.

11:03.230 --> 11:03.790
Boss—

11:03.790 --> 11:04.600
Rei.

11:05.200 --> 11:07.710
You are the Suwa family's heir.

11:07.710 --> 11:10.680
In order to preserve our 
history and bloodline,

11:10.680 --> 11:12.820
I will rid you of all distractions.

11:13.180 --> 11:17.740
That is my duty as the current 
head of the Suwa family.

11:27.240 --> 11:28.450
Yeah?

11:28.450 --> 11:29.940
Hey. What is it?

11:29.940 --> 11:31.720
<i>Kazuki! Where are you?</i>

11:31.720 --> 11:35.000
Uh, on my way back from Kyu-chan's...

11:35.000 --> 11:36.150
Tonight's dinner—

11:36.150 --> 11:37.480
<i>Go to Miri, now!</i>

11:37.480 --> 11:39.180
<i>Please. Hurry!</i>

11:41.940 --> 11:44.040
<i>What, leave something behind?</i>

11:44.040 --> 11:46.520
Kyu-chan! Can you contact Miri's mom?!

11:46.780 --> 11:49.220
Tell them to get out of there! Now!

12:00.450 --> 12:01.720
Coming.

12:03.180 --> 12:04.440
Who is it?

12:04.860 --> 12:06.440
Package delivery.

12:06.440 --> 12:07.940
A package?

12:07.940 --> 12:11.690
It's from "Kurusu."

12:11.690 --> 12:13.560
More of Miri's things?

12:37.180 --> 12:39.060
You may be feeling confused.

12:43.380 --> 12:46.840
"What's happening? Why me?"

12:46.840 --> 12:48.850
A very natural question.

12:48.850 --> 12:51.150
You haven't done anything wrong.

12:51.780 --> 12:55.820
My client feels no hatred towards you.

12:55.820 --> 12:57.410
Or towards your daughter.

12:57.940 --> 13:02.670
He merely requires your deaths.

13:02.670 --> 13:03.650
Miri...

13:04.430 --> 13:06.450
I've answered your question.

13:06.860 --> 13:11.450
Now, tell me your last words.

13:33.240 --> 13:34.700
Kurusu Kazuki...

13:35.140 --> 13:38.030
You're one of my targets as well, but...

13:45.080 --> 13:46.810
Wait your turn.

13:46.810 --> 13:49.710
I need to hear her last words first.

13:49.710 --> 13:51.100
Then the girl's.

13:51.690 --> 13:55.590
You might not have... 
so much time to waste...

13:56.340 --> 13:58.580
Ever heard of the cops?

13:58.850 --> 14:03.610
<b>Call Completed</b>

13:59.410 --> 14:01.040
I hear they keep the peace...

14:01.040 --> 14:03.610
and uphold justice, 
or something like that...

14:03.920 --> 14:07.090
Every bit the hack the materials suggested.

14:07.090 --> 14:09.210
No matter. It'll be over soon.

14:09.210 --> 14:12.510
Nah, it's over for you now.

14:17.370 --> 14:19.610
What do you expect to accomplish?

14:21.060 --> 14:23.950
I'm just the brains of the operation.

14:24.390 --> 14:26.040
Now, Rei!

14:40.120 --> 14:42.050
A pointless act.

14:43.080 --> 14:44.940
Was not!

14:47.700 --> 14:50.190
This is the police! Drop your weapon!

14:51.010 --> 14:52.700
Time's up.

14:52.980 --> 14:54.490
Damn you.

14:57.450 --> 15:00.980
I'll leave the woman's words to you.

15:00.980 --> 15:03.530
Look after her final moments.

15:04.220 --> 15:08.540
I'll happily hear your own 
words when the time comes.

15:08.540 --> 15:10.660
Cower in fear in the meantime.

15:15.960 --> 15:18.900
Kazuki! The real cops will be here—

15:19.840 --> 15:22.270
Hey! Wake up already!

15:22.600 --> 15:23.630
Miri...

15:23.630 --> 15:26.660
Don't die, damn it! You're 
gonna make Miri cry!

15:26.950 --> 15:29.260
She's got her Christmas party coming up...

15:29.260 --> 15:32.870
Miri's in... that room there...

15:38.460 --> 15:39.440
Hurry.

15:39.440 --> 15:41.590
Time to go! You gotta get 
outta here with Miri!

15:41.950 --> 15:46.390
Please... protect Miri!

15:46.390 --> 15:48.950
It's a parent's job to protect their kid!

15:49.390 --> 15:52.770
And tell her... that I'm sorry.

15:53.340 --> 15:56.880
I couldn't make it to her Christmas party.

15:56.880 --> 15:58.010
Cut it out...

15:58.010 --> 16:00.470
Hey! Don't leave Miri all alone!

16:00.470 --> 16:02.660
She needs parents!

16:02.660 --> 16:04.520
She needs a family!

16:06.150 --> 16:07.090
Kazuki...

16:16.870 --> 16:18.640
I'm sorry...

16:18.640 --> 16:22.620
I was a selfish mother... to the end...

16:23.830 --> 16:24.790
Miri...

16:35.330 --> 16:36.380
Let's go.

16:36.380 --> 16:38.430
It'll get messy if we stay here.

16:49.270 --> 16:50.600
How's the wound?

16:50.600 --> 16:52.650
Hurts like hell.

16:53.970 --> 16:56.380
But it went through clean, 
so I should be okay.

16:56.620 --> 16:57.600
I see.

16:58.170 --> 17:02.460
Maybe we should've left 
Miri with the police.

17:02.850 --> 17:06.370
If we had, she likely would 
have told them about you.

17:07.190 --> 17:10.080
I called the police to drive off Ogino.

17:15.550 --> 17:17.430
Is this your place, Kyu-chan?

17:18.220 --> 17:20.760
The Suwa family knows where my home is.

17:21.100 --> 17:23.430
This is more like a safe house.

17:24.050 --> 17:25.990
It should be secure for a while.

17:25.990 --> 17:26.900
And Rei?

17:27.170 --> 17:28.220
I told him.

17:30.670 --> 17:31.680
Where's Miri?!

17:35.170 --> 17:36.370
She's alive.

17:38.070 --> 17:39.260
Miri is.

17:39.750 --> 17:41.490
But her mother...

17:41.490 --> 17:43.030
Did Miri— Did she—

17:43.290 --> 17:44.500
She didn't see.

17:44.500 --> 17:48.870
She doesn't even know her mom's dead yet.

17:55.240 --> 17:56.610
I'm sorry.

17:57.760 --> 17:59.490
Sorry for what?

17:59.910 --> 18:03.630
I knew the boss was 
investigating Rei's life.

18:04.200 --> 18:09.050
That's why I took Miri away from you 
and returned her to her mother.

18:09.760 --> 18:14.340
I thought that if I ended your relationship, 
the boss would leave her alone.

18:15.240 --> 18:17.680
I underestimated him.

18:17.680 --> 18:19.060
This is all my fault.

18:20.430 --> 18:21.690
No.

18:21.690 --> 18:23.480
I took them from Miri...

18:24.120 --> 18:27.280
Her father. Her mother. Everything.

18:28.210 --> 18:30.370
Mama...

18:34.590 --> 18:37.840
Miri will need food when she wakes up.

18:37.840 --> 18:39.090
So will you.

18:47.550 --> 18:49.090
What do we do now?

18:49.700 --> 18:51.490
We'll eliminate all traces of Miri.

18:52.050 --> 18:54.090
We'll make it look like she died,

18:54.090 --> 18:56.500
and wipe out every trace.

18:56.760 --> 19:00.490
Then we'll stick her in an 
orphanage somewhere far away.

19:01.080 --> 19:04.510
Please... protect Miri!

19:04.790 --> 19:07.680
We'll take her somewhere 
no one can get to her,

19:07.680 --> 19:11.490
then stay out of her life forever.

19:11.990 --> 19:13.370
I'm sorry...

19:13.370 --> 19:17.010
I was a selfish mother... to the end...

19:17.810 --> 19:18.890
Miri...

19:19.640 --> 19:22.560
We belong to the underworld anyway.

19:23.050 --> 19:24.880
We can't protect Miri,

19:24.880 --> 19:27.400
and we damn well can't make her happy!

19:29.480 --> 19:32.030
I want to take care of Miri.

19:33.040 --> 19:34.630
Don't be stupid.

19:34.630 --> 19:36.810
What can you even do?

19:36.810 --> 19:38.390
I couldn't do anything.

19:38.840 --> 19:40.520
I didn't even try.

19:41.040 --> 19:44.500
I refused to face reality, 
ran away from my father...

19:44.500 --> 19:47.040
I was little more than a breathing statue.

19:47.720 --> 19:49.240
I was okay with that.

19:50.230 --> 19:52.540
But now I've learned...

19:53.430 --> 19:55.400
That people's hands feel warm.

19:57.100 --> 19:59.560
That there are places 
that feel nice to stay.

19:59.790 --> 20:00.790
Stop it!

20:01.040 --> 20:03.720
What good will it do to 
leave Miri on her own?

20:04.240 --> 20:06.420
To take Miri's parents 
from her and just forget,

20:06.420 --> 20:09.140
without doing anything to make up for it?

20:09.700 --> 20:10.800
We...

20:11.420 --> 20:13.530
We can't be a part of Miri's life anymore!

20:13.840 --> 20:15.070
You're wrong.

20:15.070 --> 20:17.620
<i>We</i> have to protect her.

20:17.620 --> 20:21.140
Think. What can we do to help Miri?

20:21.140 --> 20:23.430
You're the brains between us, remember?

20:23.430 --> 20:24.300
Kazuki!

20:24.950 --> 20:26.930
We <i>can</i> change.

20:26.930 --> 20:29.410
This time, we'll make Miri happy!

20:33.610 --> 20:37.630
I know you can make her happy, too!

20:41.790 --> 20:43.580
Mama?

20:47.170 --> 20:48.140
Miri!

20:49.110 --> 20:51.660
Papa Kazuki? Papa Rei?

20:51.660 --> 20:53.540
What are you doing here?

20:55.170 --> 20:56.950
Where's Mama?

20:56.950 --> 20:59.190
What is this house?

20:59.190 --> 21:00.000
Miri...

21:02.800 --> 21:05.960
Mama went out. She had something to do.

21:05.960 --> 21:08.590
So you're back with us again.

21:09.250 --> 21:11.170
Will Mama be with us too?

21:11.170 --> 21:13.670
Yeah, once she gets back.

21:13.670 --> 21:15.470
Yes!

21:22.570 --> 21:24.900
We take turns tucking her in.

21:24.900 --> 21:27.260
Don't skip out on taking her 
back and forth from daycare.

21:27.920 --> 21:31.070
Same with tooth-brushing after the bath.

21:31.420 --> 21:34.480
I'll cook, but you need to help clean.

21:34.480 --> 21:37.570
No washing dishes until the 
dry ones are put away.

21:37.950 --> 21:41.700
When you run the vacuum, move anything 
on the floor out of the way.

21:41.940 --> 21:46.380
I read online that kids pick
up on little stuff like that.

21:48.590 --> 21:50.750
If you're gonna argue for it that hard,

21:50.750 --> 21:53.930
at least respect the household rules!

21:53.930 --> 21:54.800
Okay.

21:57.030 --> 21:57.810
Is game time—

21:57.810 --> 21:58.800
One hour per day!

21:58.800 --> 21:59.760
No way!

22:04.440 --> 22:05.640
What is it?

22:05.640 --> 22:06.670
Kyu-chan...

22:07.280 --> 22:10.460
Looks like we're out of the hitman business.

22:11.090 --> 22:12.470
Really?

22:12.470 --> 22:15.180
We're going to be Miri's fathers.

22:17.060 --> 22:21.660
You're going to follow through on that false 
relationship, bearing the weight of your sin?

22:21.660 --> 22:23.980
It won't be a false relationship.

22:24.310 --> 22:28.700
This time, we're gonna be a real family!

22:29.950 --> 22:35.000
<i>The scenery never changes and 
every day is full of surprises</i>

22:35.000 --> 22:39.460
<i>But those are the best parts</i>

22:39.460 --> 22:44.210
<i>Wrapped around your finger 
and going in circles</i>

22:44.460 --> 22:49.090
<i>These days are dizzying yet endearing</i>

22:49.300 --> 22:53.640
<i>On your restless nights, 
I softly whisper a lullaby</i>

22:53.640 --> 22:58.390
<i>And stroke your hair to the 
rhythm of your breathing</i>

22:58.850 --> 23:02.980
<i>I just want these days to 
continue as long as possible</i>

23:02.980 --> 23:07.990
<i>Even if it's just a day</i>

23:08.780 --> 23:13.700
<i>I chased after you as you ran barefoot</i>

23:13.700 --> 23:17.910
<i>Maybe one day, you'll surpass me, ah</i>

23:17.910 --> 23:22.580
<i>I wonder what tomorrow's going to be like</i>

23:22.580 --> 23:27.510
<i>Why don't we walk together?</i>

23:27.510 --> 23:32.260
<i>This will always be our place to come home to</i>

23:32.760 --> 23:37.060
<i>And it'll shine down on our sadness</i>

23:37.060 --> 23:41.730
<i>That's all right, yeah, that's okay</i>

23:41.730 --> 23:46.650
<i>Let's try to share our love together</i>

23:46.650 --> 23:50.070
<i>Let the light always shine upon hope</i>

23:50.070 --> 23:56.580
<i>When the future is unpredictable</i>
